    <briefdescription>
<para>The API between Java host environment and an XVM runtime. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>For a given <ref refid="df/de5/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1api_1_1_connector" kindref="compound">Connector</ref> there is one and only one <ref refid="d8/dd6/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1runtime_1_1_runtime" kindref="compound">Runtime</ref> and one and only one top level Container. All underlying Containers will use the same <ref refid="d8/dd6/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1runtime_1_1_runtime" kindref="compound">Runtime</ref>. </para>
<para>Normally, the usage of the <ref refid="df/de5/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1api_1_1_connector" kindref="compound">Connector</ref> follows these steps: <itemizedlist>
<listitem>
<para>instantiate a <ref refid="df/de5/classorg_1_1xvm_1_1api_1_1_connector" kindref="compound">Connector</ref> </para>
</listitem>
<listitem>
<para>add necessary module repositories </para>
